Source: https://docs.rs/landlock/0.4.3/src/landlock/scope.rs.html

The `Scope::from_all` function provides a way to get all available scope flags for a given ABI version. For ABI versions up to and including `ABI::V5`, `Scope::from_all` returns an empty set of flags. For `ABI::V6`, it returns flags for `Scope::AbstractUnixSocket` and `Scope::Signal`.

